Blocked", "keywords": ["brick", "puzzle", "stacker", "block"], "long_description": "The ultimate block-stacking puzzle experience is here!\n\nStep into a world of immersive virtual reality and rediscover the timeless fun of Tetris-style block puzzles. Rotate, move, and drop falling blocks into place as you race to complete lines, earn points, and keep the board from filling up.\n\nEasy to pick up but challenging to master, this addictive puzzle experience puts your spatial awareness, quick thinking, and reflexes to the test.\n\nEvery move matters. Plan your strategy, find the perfect placement, clear multiple lines, and push your score higher with every session.\n\nWhether you're a longtime fan of classic block puzzles or discovering this addictive gameplay for the first time, get ready for an engaging VR experience that will keep you coming back for more.\n\nThink Fast. Stack Smart. Clear Lines. Beat Your Best!", "short_description": "Experience the classic block-stacking puzzle game like never before in immersive VR! Rotate, stack, and drop colorful blocks, clear lines, beat your high scores, and challenge your puzzle-solving skills in an addictive virtual reality experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Gravity Labs", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://gravitylabs1.wixsite.com/website-1", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "s